  "new_mechanism_findings": [
    "Lighting inputs are evaluated for each light in a Light Accumulation input tree;nonlinear banding before vs after summation is not equivalent",
    "Official5.3 Light Info implicitly reads the current light and has no light-object selector;Goo name equivalence is insufficient",
    "Light Evaluation Mask is distance cutoff/spot cone permission,not geometric visibility",
    "Shadow Raycast is the independent light-shadow mask,1unoccluded/0occluded;the name alone does not prove hardware ray tracing or per-character IDs",
    "Power divided bypi and reflection Factor multiplied bypi are documented conventions;do not copy numerical controls across interfaces blindly",
    "Light Evaluation supports explicit position/normal in5.3 documentation;this is not evidence that the known ignored Goo5.2 inputs work"
  ],
